  "contractId": "CCUN4RXU5VNDHSF4S4RKV4ZJYMX2YWKOH6L4AKEKVNVDQ7HY5QIAO4UB",
  "description": "FxDAO Vaults (contracts/vaults) - the protocol's collateralized stablecoin vault. Locks XLM as collateral and mints FxDAO-issued debt (USDx/EURx/GBPx) against it, tracking one vault per borrower and denomination, and exposes opening, repayment, redemption and liquidation of under-collateralised vaults. Deployed once per network by the FxDAO DAO account; this is the mainnet instance.",
